				4.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στραφήσῃ εἰς ἄνδρα
			ἄλλον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				10.6
			</span></i>; <i>transmute</i> metals, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
