			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IX.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέπω</span>
