			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.352
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρεφθεὶς μετόπισθεν</span>
			<i>turning</i> back, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.645
			</span></i>; <i>return</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1648
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				315
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στραφέντες ἔφευγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.3.63
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				3.5.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῖ στρέφει</span>; <i>whither
				away?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				230
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				610
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the
			heavenly bodies, <i>revolve, circle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.274
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				40b
			</span></i>; of the distaff, <i><span class="en">
