				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				8.15
			</span></i>: c. gen. causae, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δὲ σοῦ ψόφου
				οὐκ ἂν στραφείην</span>
			<i>I would</i> not <i>turn for</i> any noise of thine, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1117
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be always engaged in</i> or <i>about</i>, 
