					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1004b22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2p.124S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>to be</i>
